            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cooksinpa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this (without celery) and even my sister-in-law who does not like cranberry salad had to try it after everyone raved about it. It turned out great with a nice firm texture and a tantalizing combination of flavors. Oh, I also added small cubes of honeycrisp apple which I put in the orange juice so it wouldn't turn brown while doing the juice/gelatin part. that added a nice touch. Thanks for sharing this wonderful recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2009-12-26T21:16:44.993Z"
          },
          {
