            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SilkyTofu2930"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family absolutely loved this recipe for Thanksgiving. So much simpler than cooking whole cranberries the way I used to. I did add chopped walnuts, chopped apple &amp; mandarin oranges. Super easy and so delicious. Thank you for sharing.",
            "datePublished": "2022-11-24T05:55:19.275Z"
          },
