            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lauraM"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have made this twice for holiday meals. I really like it. I have made with celery and with apple as a substitution. Both are good. You can play around with the ingredients/flavors as many reviewer's suggest. If nothing else, it is a pretty addition to the holiday spread!",
            "datePublished": "2019-01-30T20:55:56.753Z"
